# Security Policy

## Reporting a Vulnerability

If you find a security issue, please email {{ author_email if author_email else 'maintainers@example.com' }}. Do not open a public issue.

We will respond within 7 days with next steps.

## Supported Versions

| Version | Supported          |
| ------- | ------------------ |
| 0.1.x   | :white_check_mark: |

## Security Best Practices

- Keep dependencies up to date.
- Run `pip-audit` or `uv pip audit` regularly.
- Do not commit secrets to the repository.